# Alacrian Armory: "Creatures you control get +0/+1 and have vigilance" (CR 613.4c, 702.20): Bot1's Savannah Lions and Caustic
# Bronco gain both, Bot2's Savannah Lions neither. "At the beginning of combat on your turn, choose up to one target Mount or
# Vehicle you control": Bot1's Savannah Lions (neither) and Bot2's Air Response Unit (a Vehicle, but not Bot1's) are refused, and the
# Caustic Bronco, a Mount, becomes saddled until end of turn (CR 702.171b), which is gone again by turn 5. Lions attack and stay untapped.

